		{ String _name = "DSJaBJettyDriftWoodCollectorSLCTTip";		String _text = "searches and collects logs or firewood from waterways, as such this is slower than the collector. employs a minimum of 2 workers. Requires 34 work to build. This building only has a limited life of production (approx 5 years) and will eventually expire of available resources, after which it will become a derelict jetty building. The building can then be set to start demolishing, in which the new building will generate a small amount of logs and firewood, after which it can then be completely demolished with the remove structures tool."; }
