		{ String _name = "DSJaBJettyHomeWSTip";				String _text = "A small jetty home for 2 citizens, though lacking in space and unable to accommodate a growing family, the workers shack does have the benefit of having the better heat and fuel usage than the other workers housing options. 500cap. 1x2. Requires 21 work to build. Buildable over water or on ground - make sure the front door is accessible by citizens. Heating: temp for fuel 50 deg, heat from fuel 70."; }
				
