		{ String _name = "DSJaBJettyHome3x2Tip";			String _text = "A small jetty home for 4 citizens, larger living quarters with an overhead living space. Heating is poorer in this workers home due to the larger area to heat. 900cap. 3x2. Requires 34 work to build. Buildable over water or on ground - make sure the front door is accessible by citizens. Heating: temp for fuel 50 deg, heat from fuel 65."; }
		
		
